WEBVTT

1
00:01:00.517 --> 00:01:02.689
Whoever gets
to the temple first wins!

2
00:01:02.827 --> 00:01:05.034
What? Aang. no fair!

3
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.103
Let's get him!

4
00:01:08.241 --> 00:01:09.586
Come on. hurry up!

5
00:01:17.655 --> 00:01:19.275
Hi. Nima.
Good morning. Aang.

6
00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:20.793
Hey. Mip-Mip.
Oh. hello. Aang.

7
00:01:27.758 --> 00:01:29.551
Oh. perfect timing.
Huh?

8
00:01:30.137 --> 00:01:31.517
Mind giving me a lift?

9
00:01:31.655 --> 00:01:33.551
Gyatso. this isn't
the best time.

10
00:01:33.689 --> 00:01:35.344
I'm getting old. you know.

11
00:01:35.482 --> 00:01:37.655
My body doesn't move
like it used to.

12
00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:39.827
I'm kind of
in the middle of something.

13
00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:41.310
You are so heavy!

14
00:01:41.448 --> 00:01:44.655
Heavy? Me?
I eat nothing but vegetables.

15
00:01:44.793 --> 00:01:46.586
Pie is not a vegetable.

16
00:01:46.724 --> 00:01:48.206
I'm gonna lose the race!

17
00:01:48.379 --> 00:01:50.448
Race? What race?

18
00:01:50.586 --> 00:01:51.724
We finally won!

19
00:01:51.827 --> 00:01:53.034
We won! We won!

20
00:01:53.206 --> 00:01:55.172
Yay. we did it!

21
00:01:59.034 --> 00:02:01.551
Aang. as an Airbender.

22
00:02:01.689 --> 00:02:04.551
it's important that you know
when to show restraint.

23
00:02:06.034 --> 00:02:08.241
Even if you have
the power to win.

24
00:02:08.655 --> 00:02:10.068
you are the Avatar.

25
00:02:10.241 --> 00:02:14.275
A lot of people
are going to rely on you.

26
00:02:24.068 --> 00:02:26.068
Where's the Avatar?

27
00:02:26.206 --> 00:02:27.862
He's gone! He ran away!

28
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.413
What? I'm here!

29
00:02:30.206 --> 00:02:32.758
Where's the Avatar?
Avatar!

30
00:02:33.206 --> 00:02:35.517
Aang! Where are you?

31
00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:37.206
Gyatso! I'm here!

32
00:02:40.241 --> 00:02:42.655
I'm... I'm... here!

33
00:02:42.793 --> 00:02:44.931
I'm here! I'm here!

34
00:02:45.103 --> 00:02:46.413
Here!

35
00:02:47.034 --> 00:02:48.103
I'm here.

36
00:02:52.344 --> 00:02:53.758
Hey. Momo.

37
00:02:54.551 --> 00:02:55.655
Hi. Appa.

38
00:02:55.758 --> 00:02:57.413
Was I asleep for long?

39
00:02:57.551 --> 00:02:59.310
Okay. okay.
I'm awake already.

40
00:02:59.413 --> 00:03:02.310
I know. I know.
We've got a job to finish.

41
00:03:02.827 --> 00:03:05.586
Let's continue our journey.

42
00:03:06.103 --> 00:03:07.172
Back to our old home.

43
00:03:55.344 --> 00:03:56.965
This may not
have been our best trip.

44
00:03:57.103 --> 00:04:00.206
but any Airbender relic we find
makes it all worthwhile.

45
00:04:05.965 --> 00:04:08.379
This could be the oldest piece
in our collection.

46
00:04:14.206 --> 00:04:15.724
"Sonam."

47
00:04:28.241 --> 00:04:29.448
I miss you.

48
00:04:35.758 --> 00:04:37.931
Momo. go outside with Appa.

49
00:04:39.724 --> 00:04:40.793
Now!

50
00:04:45.068 --> 00:04:46.206
Whoa!

51
00:04:49.862 --> 00:04:52.137
Who are you?
Why are you doing this?

52
00:04:56.068 --> 00:04:58.758
Please stop.
I don't want to hurt you.

53
00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:03.862
Where is it?
Where is it?

54
00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.379
No. that's not it.

55
00:05:05.517 --> 00:05:06.793
Hey. those are antiques.

56
00:05:18.344 --> 00:05:19.655
Enough!

57
00:05:22.793 --> 00:05:25.517
Wait! I found it!

58
00:05:27.241 --> 00:05:29.172
Sonam? Why are they after you?

59
00:05:48.034 --> 00:05:49.000
Wait!

60
00:05:52.103 --> 00:05:54.689
No! That's a thousand years old!

61
00:05:59.137 --> 00:06:00.241
Give it to me!

62
00:06:00.379 --> 00:06:02.206
Why don't we just talk?
Maybe I can help.

63
00:06:02.344 --> 00:06:04.379
We don't need your help. Avatar.

64
00:06:05.172 --> 00:06:07.931
We're done living in a world
where Benders have all the power

65
00:06:08.068 --> 00:06:10.000
and we have none.
Who are you?

66
00:06:10.137 --> 00:06:11.206
We're the Denied.

67
00:06:11.344 --> 00:06:12.482
The Denied?

68
00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.793
Just kill him already!

69
00:06:13.931 --> 00:06:15.862
No! You'll bring
the whole place down!

70
00:06:42.655 --> 00:06:44.689
You... saved me.

71
00:06:46.724 --> 00:06:48.896
Kallik. grab the map.
Let’s go!

72
00:07:03.137 --> 00:07:04.034
Oh. no!

73
00:08:00.448 --> 00:08:02.655
I'm fine.

74
00:08:02.793 --> 00:08:04.137
Momo. I'm fine.

75
00:08:07.137 --> 00:08:09.034
But we've got
to get to Republic City.

76
00:08:10.206 --> 00:08:12.068
Appa. yip-yip!

77
00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.344
Water.

78
00:08:30.827 --> 00:08:33.379
Her tribes gather strength
from the moon

79
00:08:34.448 --> 00:08:36.517
and flow with the tides.

80
00:08:38.068 --> 00:08:39.000
Earth.

81
00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:45.137
A kingdom of unshakable will.
reliable and strong.

82
00:08:48.206 --> 00:08:49.241
Fire.

83
00:08:49.827 --> 00:08:52.724
A nation capable
of great destruction.

84
00:08:53.931 --> 00:08:57.137
but also of great warmth.

85
00:08:59.517 --> 00:09:00.689
Air.

86
00:09:00.965 --> 00:09:03.758
Peaceful nomads with
the power of a hurricane.

87
00:09:04.034 --> 00:09:06.551
but the spirit
of a gentle breeze.

88
00:09:08.655 --> 00:09:11.379
For generations. the Avatar.

89
00:09:11.517 --> 00:09:14.241
the one master
of all four elements.

90
00:09:14.413 --> 00:09:16.620
kept the nations in balance.

91
00:09:18.034 --> 00:09:21.655
But when that responsibility
fell to me as a child.

92
00:09:21.793 --> 00:09:23.000
I ran away.

93
00:09:23.413 --> 00:09:25.482
I was caught in a deadly storm.

94
00:09:25.896 --> 00:09:29.068
but my Avatar spirit
preserved me
in a sphere of energy

95
00:09:29.206 --> 00:09:33.068
where I stayed
for a hundred years.

96
00:09:33.241 --> 00:09:34.448
I woke to discover

97
00:09:34.586 --> 00:09:37.034
that the balance
preserved by the Avatar

98
00:09:37.172 --> 00:09:40.068
had been destroyed by war.

99
00:09:40.206 --> 00:09:42.551
The Air Nomads were gone.

100
00:09:43.275 --> 00:09:44.896
All but one.

101
00:09:45.034 --> 00:09:45.896
Me.

102
00:09:46.517 --> 00:09:49.000
I could no longer run
from my responsibility

103
00:09:49.103 --> 00:09:50.517
as the Avatar.

104
00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:53.896
I found allies
from every nation.

105
00:09:54.344 --> 00:09:56.758
Benders and Nonbenders.

106
00:09:58.482 --> 00:10:00.413
Katara taught me
how to waterbend.

107
00:10:01.103 --> 00:10:04.068
Toph trained me in the ways
of the Earthbenders.

108
00:10:04.689 --> 00:10:09.172
Zuko. once my worst enemy.
became my firebending teacher.

109
00:10:09.965 --> 00:10:13.448
Sokka showed me that bravery
is the most important part

110
00:10:13.551 --> 00:10:15.655
of being a leader.

111
00:10:15.793 --> 00:10:17.793
We became a family.

112
00:10:18.724 --> 00:10:22.172
And together. we ended
the Hundred Year War.

113
00:10:23.241 --> 00:10:27.931
Then. we began the hard work
of rebuilding the world.

114
00:10:39.551 --> 00:10:42.517
For so long.
the nation stood apart.

115
00:10:42.655 --> 00:10:43.551
alone.

116
00:10:43.965 --> 00:10:45.482
and we all suffered
as a result.

117
00:10:45.586 --> 00:10:48.482
But here.
on this ancient site.

118
00:10:48.586 --> 00:10:51.172
we created a place
where all people are welcome.

119
00:10:51.724 --> 00:10:53.862
Bender and Nonbender alike.

120
00:10:53.965 --> 00:10:57.758
working together in peace
to build the future.

121
00:10:57.896 --> 00:11:00.206
Though there are still
those who would seek

122
00:11:00.344 --> 00:11:03.241
to divide us.
we remain united.

123
00:11:03.896 --> 00:11:05.379
As a council representative.

124
00:11:05.482 --> 00:11:07.655
I am honored
to be here today

125
00:11:07.793 --> 00:11:10.655
celebrating the anniversary
of Republic City

126
00:11:10.827 --> 00:11:13.000
and the opening
of Unity Tower.

127
00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:15.482
a symbol for all people.

128
00:11:21.896 --> 00:11:23.000
Look!

129
00:11:23.172 --> 00:11:24.275
Yeah!

130
00:11:24.413 --> 00:11:26.137
It's the Avatar!

131
00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:31.793
Whoo!
Whoo!

132
00:11:37.448 --> 00:11:38.620
Momo!

133
00:11:41.068 --> 00:11:42.620
Appa!

134
00:11:42.758 --> 00:11:44.724
I missed you too.
old friend.

135
00:11:46.827 --> 00:11:47.965
Aang!

136
00:11:48.137 --> 00:11:49.000
Katara!

137
00:11:49.172 --> 00:11:50.137
Mm!

138
00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.620
You're hurt.

139
00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.793
Take a deep breath.

140
00:12:07.068 --> 00:12:09.379
And... exhale.

141
00:12:10.689 --> 00:12:12.689
I've heard the Denied
are growing in numbers.

142
00:12:12.827 --> 00:12:14.862
but they've never
done anything like this.

143
00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.206
Attacking the Avatar?

144
00:12:16.379 --> 00:12:17.689
Yeah.

145
00:12:17.827 --> 00:12:19.551
They were incredible fighters.

146
00:12:20.068 --> 00:12:21.862
Even without bending.

147
00:12:23.586 --> 00:12:26.000
Oops. Breathe through it.
Ow!

148
00:12:26.137 --> 00:12:28.068
Be honest.
You're enjoying this.

149
00:12:28.206 --> 00:12:30.172
Aang. this is serious.

150
00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.137
Whatever this map
they took was.

151
00:12:32.241 --> 00:12:34.862
if they were willing
to kill the Avatar to get it.

152
00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.896
what else
are they willing to do?

153
00:12:37.379 --> 00:12:39.310
I don't know.

154
00:12:39.448 --> 00:12:40.965
I'm worried about you.

155
00:12:41.655 --> 00:12:43.137
You're spending more
and more time

156
00:12:43.241 --> 00:12:45.206
at the Air Temple. alone.

157
00:12:46.551 --> 00:12:49.241
It's how I hold on to my past.

158
00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.689
I know how hard
this is for you.

159
00:12:57.793 --> 00:12:59.379
When I was attacked.

160
00:13:00.034 --> 00:13:02.482
all I could think about
was that...

161
00:13:03.241 --> 00:13:04.758
this could be it.

162
00:13:06.137 --> 00:13:08.758
I'm the last Airbender.

163
00:13:10.034 --> 00:13:14.068
If I die.
my culture dies with me.

164
00:13:16.793 --> 00:13:20.689
You may be the last Airbender.
but you're not alone.

165
00:13:21.413 --> 00:13:25.413
Aang. none of this
would exist without you.

166
00:13:26.655 --> 00:13:29.034
You made the city possible
with your heart

167
00:13:29.137 --> 00:13:30.482
and your mind.

168
00:13:32.068 --> 00:13:33.379
Because of you...

169
00:13:33.896 --> 00:13:35.931
all of the nations
live here...

170
00:13:36.068 --> 00:13:37.275
together.

171
00:13:39.275 --> 00:13:40.931
All except mine.

172
00:13:50.931 --> 00:13:52.137
I know...

173
00:13:52.482 --> 00:13:55.241
but the people here
still need your protection.

174
00:13:55.896 --> 00:13:58.344
You're an Airbender...

175
00:13:58.448 --> 00:14:00.482
but you're also the Avatar.

176
00:14:02.689 --> 00:14:03.931
You're right.

177
00:14:05.034 --> 00:14:08.862
Whoever this Sonam person is.
I need to find out more.

178
00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.724
Aang.

179
00:14:35.827 --> 00:14:37.000
Avatar Roku.

180
00:14:37.172 --> 00:14:39.482
It is good
to see you again.

181
00:14:39.655 --> 00:14:41.000
How can I help you?

182
00:14:41.172 --> 00:14:43.137
In your lifetime.
did you ever hear

183
00:14:43.275 --> 00:14:45.517
of an ancient Airbender
named Sonam?

184
00:14:45.655 --> 00:14:46.862
I have not.

185
00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:50.137
but you have many
past lives to call upon.

186
00:14:50.275 --> 00:14:52.931
Perhaps one further back
in the Avatar cycle

187
00:14:53.068 --> 00:14:54.689
can help you.

188
00:14:55.137 --> 00:14:56.482
Thank you. Avatar Roku.

189
00:14:58.827 --> 00:15:00.620
I'm sorry.
I've never heard of Sonam.

190
00:15:00.758 --> 00:15:02.482
I'm unfamiliar.
Perhaps earlier.

191
00:15:02.586 --> 00:15:03.896
You must go further back.

192
00:15:04.413 --> 00:15:06.034
PAST AVATARS. OVERLAPPING:
You must go further back.
Not here.

193
00:15:06.172 --> 00:15:07.896
...in the Avatar Cycle.

194
00:15:14.551 --> 00:15:16.413
Um. hello?

195
00:15:17.448 --> 00:15:18.965
Is there anyone here?

196
00:15:20.172 --> 00:15:21.448
Hello?

197
00:15:23.344 --> 00:15:26.206
Who calls upon Avatar Xian's

198
00:15:26.344 --> 00:15:28.620
vast wealth of knowledge?

199
00:15:32.448 --> 00:15:33.620
Oh. hello.

200
00:15:33.931 --> 00:15:37.448
You look like an Avatar
from a time
quite distant from mine.

201
00:15:37.586 --> 00:15:40.379
Please. please.
tell me about your era.

202
00:15:40.517 --> 00:15:42.172
What are people wearing?

203
00:15:42.275 --> 00:15:43.862
Are sandals still a thing?

204
00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.206
Uh. yes.

205
00:15:45.344 --> 00:15:46.655
Why?

206
00:15:46.758 --> 00:15:49.068
Why. after so many years.

207
00:15:49.206 --> 00:15:53.068
open toes. seeing someone
else's crusty cuticles?

208
00:15:53.379 --> 00:15:54.758
Disgusting!

209
00:15:54.931 --> 00:15:55.896
Right.

210
00:15:56.137 --> 00:15:58.103
Anyway. I have come
for your guidance.

211
00:15:58.241 --> 00:15:59.655
You see. I was attacked.

212
00:15:59.758 --> 00:16:01.827
It was not me. okay?
Wasn't me.

213
00:16:01.965 --> 00:16:03.000
I know that.

214
00:16:03.137 --> 00:16:04.448
I think it might have
something to do

215
00:16:04.586 --> 00:16:06.310
with an Airbender named Sonam.

216
00:16:06.448 --> 00:16:08.344
Hmm. Sonam.

217
00:16:08.482 --> 00:16:10.103
It sounds familiar.

218
00:16:10.241 --> 00:16:12.724
Sonam.
Where have I heard
that name before?

219
00:16:12.827 --> 00:16:13.827
Ah-ha!

220
00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.620
Sonam was the youngest daughter
of the owner

221
00:16:15.758 --> 00:16:17.931
of the possum-chicken shop
at the corner marketplace.

222
00:16:18.068 --> 00:16:20.827
Wait. that was my ex.
So Nyung.

223
00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.103
If only she didn't have
those humongous toenails.

224
00:16:24.241 --> 00:16:25.827
Disgusting.

225
00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.068
This is going nowhere.

226
00:16:27.206 --> 00:16:28.793
Sonam... So-nahm...
Sonum?

227
00:16:28.931 --> 00:16:31.344
Well.
thank you for your time.

228
00:16:31.517 --> 00:16:33.379
I must continue my search.

229
00:16:33.517 --> 00:16:35.413
Oh. Sonam!

230
00:16:35.551 --> 00:16:39.586
You're asking about the legend
of the lost Avatar.

231
00:16:39.965 --> 00:16:41.586
Sonam was an Avatar?

232
00:16:41.724 --> 00:16:43.275
Indeed she was!

233
00:16:43.413 --> 00:16:45.103
She was the Avatar

234
00:16:45.241 --> 00:16:47.931
in the golden age
of Airbenders.

235
00:16:48.068 --> 00:16:50.758
Legend said she had
a staff that could channel

236
00:16:50.896 --> 00:16:53.724
the vast energy
of the Spirit World.

237
00:16:53.827 --> 00:16:57.103
granting its keeper
unlimited power.

238
00:16:57.241 --> 00:16:59.517
Is... Is that even possible?

239
00:17:00.482 --> 00:17:02.586
Eh. we'll never know for sure.

240
00:17:02.724 --> 00:17:05.206
Many Avatars have tried
to communicate with her.

241
00:17:05.344 --> 00:17:06.379
but they couldn't.

242
00:17:06.517 --> 00:17:08.068
She disappeared
so completely

243
00:17:08.206 --> 00:17:11.068
that it was as if
she never existed.

244
00:17:11.241 --> 00:17:13.344
And perhaps
it's better that way.

245
00:17:13.862 --> 00:17:16.206
Maybe such a staff
was too dangerous

246
00:17:16.344 --> 00:17:20.000
for anyone to possess.
even the Avatar.

247
00:17:20.137 --> 00:17:22.724
But... But that's exactly
why I need to find it.

248
00:17:22.896 --> 00:17:25.482
The people who attacked me
discovered a map.

249
00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.310
It must lead to the staff.

250
00:17:27.758 --> 00:17:29.689
Avatar Xian. please.

251
00:17:29.862 --> 00:17:32.034
you have to tell me
where it is.

252
00:17:34.344 --> 00:17:38.034
The legend says that Sonam
disappeared with her staff

253
00:17:38.206 --> 00:17:40.586
on the peak
of Mount Baihu.

254
00:17:43.068 --> 00:17:45.965
"Katara. I'm sorry
to leave so suddenly.

255
00:17:46.068 --> 00:17:48.172
but I found out
what the Denied are after."

256
00:17:48.965 --> 00:17:51.275
"Sonam had a staff
of immense power.

257
00:17:51.758 --> 00:17:52.896
and in their hands.

258
00:17:53.034 --> 00:17:55.172
it could be
a devastating weapon."

259
00:17:55.793 --> 00:17:57.275
"They have a head start."

260
00:17:57.379 --> 00:17:58.931
"There's no time to waste."

261
00:17:59.896 --> 00:18:03.034
"You take Appa and Momo
and gather up
the rest of the team."

262
00:18:03.137 --> 00:18:04.655
"We're gonna need some help."

263
00:18:11.241 --> 00:18:12.517
Next on the agenda.

264
00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:14.586
a Fire Nation naval vessel
came into conflict

265
00:18:14.724 --> 00:18:17.724
with an extremist group
of Nonbenders called the Denied.

266
00:18:17.827 --> 00:18:20.896
They've been
robbing ancient sites...
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

267
00:18:21.034 --> 00:18:23.620
An urgent message has arrived
from Republic City.

268
00:18:23.758 --> 00:18:24.896
How impudent.

269
00:18:25.034 --> 00:18:26.586
Can't you see
Fire Lord Zuko is...

270
00:18:26.724 --> 00:18:27.931
Chamberlain.

271
00:18:28.827 --> 00:18:30.551
There's only one person
who can send a message

272
00:18:30.655 --> 00:18:32.896
urgent enough to interrupt
the Fire Lord's counsel.

273
00:18:33.275 --> 00:18:35.172
Is it from the Avatar?
Yes. my lord.

274
00:18:35.275 --> 00:18:38.068
Read it to me.
Yes. my lord.

275
00:18:40.241 --> 00:18:41.586
Um...

276
00:18:41.758 --> 00:18:42.862
What are you doing?

277
00:18:42.965 --> 00:18:44.068
Read it quickly.

278
00:18:44.206 --> 00:18:46.551
Uh... Yeah. yeah.
Yes. Grand Chamberlain.

279
00:18:47.965 --> 00:18:50.827
"Flameo Hotman.
how's ruling the Fire Nation?"

280
00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:54.655
"I hope the boring Chamberlain
you mention in your letters

281
00:18:54.793 --> 00:18:57.275
isn't still annoying you."

282
00:18:57.413 --> 00:19:00.448
"Anyhoo. to cut to the chase.
I need your help."

283
00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:02.689
"Can you please
come immediately?"

284
00:19:02.827 --> 00:19:06.655
"Oh. and don't forget to bring
some firecracker buns."

285
00:19:09.034 --> 00:19:11.689
Allow me
to present Sokka-Cycle.

286
00:19:11.827 --> 00:19:13.206
Flames launch you into the sky

287
00:19:13.344 --> 00:19:15.862
where you can drop
water bombs on your enemies.

288
00:19:16.034 --> 00:19:18.689
then skis pop out
to help you stick the landing.

289
00:19:18.827 --> 00:19:20.310
Pretty great. right?

290
00:19:20.448 --> 00:19:21.655
Eh. boring.

291
00:19:22.034 --> 00:19:23.965
Why would you need a sled
when you can just waterbend?

292
00:19:24.103 --> 00:19:25.620
Ooh. ooh. ooh.
Like me. like me!

293
00:19:25.758 --> 00:19:26.655
Whee!

294
00:19:26.827 --> 00:19:28.000
Keep in mind.
there are still

295
00:19:28.137 --> 00:19:29.931
plenty of folks like me
who can't bend.

296
00:19:30.068 --> 00:19:32.620
Why would Avatar Aang
partner with a Nonbender?

297
00:19:32.758 --> 00:19:35.379
Why?
I'll tell you why.

298
00:19:35.517 --> 00:19:36.931
I saved him from the iceberg.

299
00:19:37.034 --> 00:19:38.413
My boomerang flew by his side

300
00:19:38.517 --> 00:19:40.896
while I parried away enemies
with my trusty blade.

301
00:19:41.068 --> 00:19:44.310
I even took down the whole
Fire Nation airship armada.

302
00:19:46.275 --> 00:19:47.551
And on top of all that.

303
00:19:47.655 --> 00:19:49.551
I was more popular than him.

304
00:19:50.689 --> 00:19:52.137
You're such a liar. Sokka.

305
00:19:55.379 --> 00:19:56.551
It's from the Avatar.

306
00:19:56.689 --> 00:19:58.379
Really?
That's so cool!
Wow.

307
00:19:58.517 --> 00:20:00.344
Oh. so now
you think I'm cool?

308
00:20:01.551 --> 00:20:03.517
All right. Metalbenders.

309
00:20:03.689 --> 00:20:05.724
Let's see if
any of you tenderfoots

310
00:20:05.827 --> 00:20:07.482
can at least make me
use my hands.

311
00:20:40.655 --> 00:20:43.517
I'm still the greatest
Earthbender in the world!

312
00:20:45.034 --> 00:20:46.206
And I'm bored.

313
00:20:46.724 --> 00:20:49.172
Master Toph.
there's a bird on your head.

314
00:20:49.344 --> 00:20:51.724
And?
It looks like it has a message.

315
00:20:51.862 --> 00:20:52.689
Read.

316
00:20:53.172 --> 00:20:55.896
Uh. it's from Avatar Aang.
He needs your help.

317
00:20:56.068 --> 00:20:57.448
It's the Denied?
The Denied?

318
00:20:57.551 --> 00:20:58.620
Where is he?

319
00:20:58.724 --> 00:21:00.241
Mount Baihu.

320
00:22:02.689 --> 00:22:04.344
No. no. no!

321
00:22:04.517 --> 00:22:05.862
No!

322
00:22:09.413 --> 00:22:11.206
I love that hat.

323
00:23:55.586 --> 00:23:57.000
Sonam?

324
00:24:01.793 --> 00:24:03.517
Could that be you?

325
00:25:06.724 --> 00:25:07.931
Who are you?

326
00:25:08.103 --> 00:25:09.931
Huh?

327
00:28:00.137 --> 00:28:01.482
Aang!

328
00:28:29.137 --> 00:28:31.793
Team Avatar to the rescue!

329
00:28:33.137 --> 00:28:34.413
Aang!

330
00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:36.034
You made it!

331
00:28:36.758 --> 00:28:38.793
You couldn't wait a day
before running off
to get yourself killed?

332
00:28:38.965 --> 00:28:41.517
I thought you were here
looking for a staff.

333
00:28:41.620 --> 00:28:42.931
Who's this guy?

334
00:28:49.551 --> 00:28:51.275
An Airbender.

335
00:29:12.000 --> 00:29:14.413
How did he hold up
an entire mountain?

336
00:29:14.517 --> 00:29:17.896
His chi is strong.
like nothing I've ever felt.

337
00:29:19.172 --> 00:29:21.724
Hey. Avatar. you think
this guy beat your record

338
00:29:21.827 --> 00:29:23.896
for longest frozen Airbender?

339
00:29:24.000 --> 00:29:27.103
Yeah. How long do you think
he was in that ice?

340
00:29:27.241 --> 00:29:28.379
I don't know.

341
00:29:28.793 --> 00:29:31.241
His tattoos look... ancient.

342
00:29:31.724 --> 00:29:33.620
He's been in there a long time.

343
00:29:33.758 --> 00:29:35.275
He smells good for an old guy.

344
00:29:35.379 --> 00:29:36.206
Ew.
What?

345
00:29:36.620 --> 00:29:38.172
My senses tell me this guy
is pretty attractive.

346
00:29:38.344 --> 00:29:39.551
Toph!
Someone else confirm.

347
00:29:39.724 --> 00:29:41.482
This is serious.
What does attractive even mean?

348
00:29:41.620 --> 00:29:43.172
Just give me
a straight confirmation.

349
00:29:43.310 --> 00:29:44.379
Is he attractive?

350
00:29:44.827 --> 00:29:46.379
He's very attractive.
Huh?

351
00:29:47.206 --> 00:29:49.000
What? He is.

352
00:29:49.137 --> 00:29:50.448
It's all in the bone structure.

353
00:29:50.586 --> 00:29:52.103
No...

354
00:29:53.482 --> 00:29:54.931
No...

355
00:29:55.034 --> 00:29:55.896
No!

356
00:29:56.000 --> 00:29:57.620
Whoa. whoa. whoa. Hey.

357
00:29:57.758 --> 00:29:59.689
Easy. you're safe.

358
00:30:02.000 --> 00:30:03.551
Earthbender!
No. no. no!

359
00:30:03.724 --> 00:30:05.655
We're all friends here.
It's okay.

360
00:30:06.137 --> 00:30:07.620
Someone woke up
on the wrong side

361
00:30:07.758 --> 00:30:08.931
of the mountain.

362
00:30:09.655 --> 00:30:10.724
Where is she?

363
00:30:12.310 --> 00:30:14.103
Where is Avatar Sonam?

364
00:30:14.206 --> 00:30:15.689
You knew Sonam?

365
00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:18.310
Who are you?

366
00:30:18.827 --> 00:30:21.034
I don't know how to explain it.

367
00:30:21.206 --> 00:30:23.344
but you've been asleep
for a long time.

368
00:30:24.655 --> 00:30:26.275
I'm the Avatar now.

369
00:30:26.620 --> 00:30:27.620
I'm Aang.

370
00:30:28.517 --> 00:30:31.862
If you're the Avatar. then...

371
00:30:32.827 --> 00:30:34.000
Sonam...

372
00:30:36.344 --> 00:30:39.310
Well. Sonam might be long gone.

373
00:30:39.448 --> 00:30:42.448
but on the bright side.
you woke up at the perfect time.

374
00:30:42.586 --> 00:30:45.206
Everyone will be amazed
to see another Airbender.

375
00:30:45.344 --> 00:30:47.724
Aang's not the last one anymore.

376
00:30:49.034 --> 00:30:51.379
What do you mean. last?

377
00:30:55.448 --> 00:30:59.137
The Air Nomads.
they've been wiped out.

378
00:31:00.931 --> 00:31:02.206
There's only me.

379
00:31:04.034 --> 00:31:05.241
No.

380
00:31:05.896 --> 00:31:08.655
Sonam's staff.
do you have it?

381
00:31:09.241 --> 00:31:10.620
It's our only hope now.

382
00:31:11.379 --> 00:31:12.586
What do you mean?

383
00:31:12.758 --> 00:31:14.344
I thought it was a weapon.

384
00:31:15.448 --> 00:31:17.172
The staff is no weapon.

385
00:31:17.931 --> 00:31:19.275
It is a gift.

386
00:31:21.758 --> 00:31:24.206
With it.
Sonam was able to channel

387
00:31:24.344 --> 00:31:26.413
the vast power
of the Spirit World.

388
00:31:27.103 --> 00:31:30.586
It was this power that
allowed Jharana to flourish.

389
00:31:31.103 --> 00:31:35.413
The greatest city in the world.
an Air Nomad utopia.

390
00:31:35.586 --> 00:31:39.448
where Sonam presided
over a golden age of balance

391
00:31:39.620 --> 00:31:43.034
and where I devoted my life
to serving her.

392
00:31:43.586 --> 00:31:45.448
In return. she raised me up

393
00:31:45.620 --> 00:31:49.724
and used her staff to give me.
a lowly Nonbender.

394
00:31:49.862 --> 00:31:52.103
the power to bend the air.

395
00:31:53.172 --> 00:31:56.206
I was the first.
but I would not be the last.

396
00:31:57.068 --> 00:31:59.241
She filled the skies
with Airbenders.

397
00:31:59.965 --> 00:32:01.482
and we flew by her side.

398
00:32:01.620 --> 00:32:03.827
spreading peace
across the world.

399
00:32:12.620 --> 00:32:16.206
Aang? Are you okay?

400
00:32:16.310 --> 00:32:19.103
Sonam used the staff
to give people airbending.

401
00:32:19.965 --> 00:32:21.344
If we found it...

402
00:32:23.137 --> 00:32:25.827
I could bring airbending
back to the world!

403
00:32:26.000 --> 00:32:27.310
This is incredible!

404
00:32:27.482 --> 00:32:30.137
There haven't been Airbenders
for over a hundred years!

405
00:32:30.896 --> 00:32:33.965
This is everything
you ever wanted. Aang.

406
00:32:35.310 --> 00:32:37.482
We could heal
the greatest atrocity

407
00:32:37.620 --> 00:32:39.448
my nation committed
in the war.

408
00:32:40.275 --> 00:32:43.275
This could be the final step
to rebuilding the world.

409
00:32:43.413 --> 00:32:46.965
Not if the Denied
get there first.
They have the map.

410
00:32:47.896 --> 00:32:49.103
Who are the Denied?

411
00:32:49.241 --> 00:32:51.379
A group of violent Nonbenders.

412
00:32:51.482 --> 00:32:52.620
They...

413
00:32:53.000 --> 00:32:55.517
They must be after the staff
to give themselves airbending.

414
00:32:55.689 --> 00:32:59.689
Then there's no time to waste.
There's only one place
it could be.

415
00:32:59.793 --> 00:33:01.034
Ready your bison.

416
00:33:01.206 --> 00:33:03.344
We'll need to travel
across the endless ocean.

417
00:33:03.482 --> 00:33:06.758
On the other side of the world?
But there's nothing out there.

418
00:33:06.862 --> 00:33:08.379
There's an island.

419
00:33:08.551 --> 00:33:10.517
The journey will not be easy.

420
00:33:10.655 --> 00:33:12.068
But we can make it.

421
00:33:13.068 --> 00:33:14.586
Then let's get going.

422
00:33:15.931 --> 00:33:18.517
The skies are no place
for a water child.

423
00:33:18.655 --> 00:33:19.862
Water child?

424
00:33:20.379 --> 00:33:24.068
Um. I know you just woke up
after thousands of years.

425
00:33:24.241 --> 00:33:26.068
but we do
these things together.

426
00:33:26.206 --> 00:33:28.620
Trust me.
We're stronger this way.

427
00:33:28.724 --> 00:33:30.413
Welcome to Team Avatar.

428
00:33:30.965 --> 00:33:32.241
What's your name?

429
00:33:32.965 --> 00:33:34.172
Tagah.

430
00:33:34.310 --> 00:33:35.931
My name is Tagah.

431
00:33:45.586 --> 00:33:48.620
Just think of it
as a big metal air bison.

432
00:33:56.379 --> 00:33:59.689
We will travel
ancient paths through the sky.

433
00:34:01.206 --> 00:34:02.448
Ones that our people learned

434
00:34:02.620 --> 00:34:04.896
by following
the great air bison herds

435
00:34:05.034 --> 00:34:07.068
that long ago
taught us airbending.

436
00:34:07.862 --> 00:34:09.551
Air currents known only to us.

437
00:34:10.344 --> 00:34:13.517
encircling the great sphere
of existence.

438
00:34:14.034 --> 00:34:16.275
allowing us to travel
where we wish.

439
00:34:16.896 --> 00:34:20.965
giving us our name.
the Air Nomads.

440
00:34:50.517 --> 00:34:52.206
What's he doing?

441
00:34:52.758 --> 00:34:54.482
He's really feeling that air.

442
00:34:54.620 --> 00:34:57.344
He's navigating by instinct.

443
00:34:57.482 --> 00:34:59.586
What if his instincts
are just wrong?

444
00:34:59.689 --> 00:35:02.206
Who needs instincts
when you've got
muscles like that?

445
00:35:02.344 --> 00:35:05.034
Or what if
his brain is messed up
from being frozen?

446
00:35:05.172 --> 00:35:08.000
Like me?
Uh. no. no!

447
00:35:08.137 --> 00:35:10.689
He was frozen for
five thousand years. okay?

448
00:35:10.862 --> 00:35:12.896
You were frozen for.
what. a hundred?

449
00:35:13.068 --> 00:35:15.241
Okay. that's nothing.
Your brain is...

450
00:35:16.206 --> 00:35:17.517
fresh.

451
00:35:17.758 --> 00:35:20.655
Maybe he is
a little old-fashioned.
but look at him.

452
00:35:20.862 --> 00:35:22.379
He's so in tune
with his element.

453
00:35:22.517 --> 00:35:25.344
he can travel
across the entire ocean

454
00:35:25.482 --> 00:35:27.758
with no map.
no instruments.

455
00:35:29.551 --> 00:35:32.517
There's so much
I can learn from him.

456
00:35:44.068 --> 00:35:47.517
I'd give anything to be able
to see my air bison again.

457
00:35:51.068 --> 00:35:54.724
And now.
to see only one remains.

458
00:35:56.862 --> 00:36:01.000
Aang. you said our people
were wiped out.

459
00:36:01.517 --> 00:36:02.965
yet you survived.

460
00:36:03.448 --> 00:36:04.586
How?

461
00:36:06.310 --> 00:36:08.793
I had just found out
I was the Avatar.

462
00:36:09.448 --> 00:36:13.379
But the responsibility.
it was too much.

463
00:36:15.137 --> 00:36:16.586
So I ran away.

464
00:36:17.620 --> 00:36:21.241
And while I was gone.
the Fire Nation attacked.

465
00:36:23.551 --> 00:36:25.137
They were looking for me.

466
00:36:26.965 --> 00:36:28.137
If...

467
00:36:28.965 --> 00:36:30.517
If I'd just been there.

468
00:36:30.965 --> 00:36:32.413
Sonam would say.

469
00:36:32.551 --> 00:36:35.275
Air Nomads are formed
from the mist.

470
00:36:35.862 --> 00:36:38.275
We walk the world
for a moment in time.

471
00:36:38.793 --> 00:36:42.241
then we return
to the eternal wind.

472
00:36:43.620 --> 00:36:45.448
Monk Gyatso taught me that.

473
00:36:46.379 --> 00:36:48.137
We carry the same weight.

474
00:36:48.275 --> 00:36:51.241
a grief no one else
could possibly comprehend.

475
00:36:51.379 --> 00:36:54.275
But you and I
can heal the past.

476
00:36:54.793 --> 00:36:58.275
Let me show you how powerful
our element can be

477
00:36:58.413 --> 00:37:00.620
when Airbenders work together.

478
00:37:03.758 --> 00:37:05.551
Tagah. what are you doing?

479
00:37:05.655 --> 00:37:06.827
Whoa!

480
00:37:06.965 --> 00:37:08.793
This is how Sonam taught me.

481
00:37:08.931 --> 00:37:11.344
Feel the energy that tethers us.

482
00:37:17.137 --> 00:37:20.000
The bond between us.
Can you feel it?

483
00:37:20.137 --> 00:37:21.137
Use it!

484
00:37:21.275 --> 00:37:22.724
This is amazing!

485
00:37:23.724 --> 00:37:25.379
Yeah!

486
00:37:27.965 --> 00:37:29.379
Woo-hoo!

487
00:37:29.551 --> 00:37:31.827
Oh. yeah!
Human boomerang!

488
00:37:31.965 --> 00:37:33.137
He's actually flying.

489
00:37:33.275 --> 00:37:34.344
So are we.

490
00:37:34.517 --> 00:37:37.000
Whoa. that's my best friend!
That's my best friend!

491
00:37:38.172 --> 00:37:39.655
Now you throw me!

492
00:38:08.172 --> 00:38:10.310
I had no idea
this was possible!

493
00:38:10.413 --> 00:38:12.413
This is only the beginning.

494
00:38:19.758 --> 00:38:21.344
I can't believe it.

495
00:38:21.862 --> 00:38:23.862
Airbenders will fill
the sky again.

496
00:38:24.275 --> 00:38:26.448
We have been
given a great gift.

497
00:38:26.896 --> 00:38:28.758
The chance to redeem ourselves.

498
00:38:29.517 --> 00:38:32.482
You were destined to find me
on that mountain. Aang.

499
00:38:34.344 --> 00:38:36.275
How did you end up there?

500
00:38:39.931 --> 00:38:42.206
The Earthbenders
had attacked Jharana.

501
00:38:42.827 --> 00:38:45.482
Sonam and I fought fearlessly.
side by side.

502
00:38:46.034 --> 00:38:48.241
We drove them
back to Mount Baihu.

503
00:38:48.379 --> 00:38:50.551
and that's the last
I remember.

504
00:38:52.241 --> 00:38:53.896
She must have saved your life.

505
00:38:54.344 --> 00:38:57.103
Only an Avatar could have
put you in that sphere.

506
00:39:00.793 --> 00:39:03.896
Aang. can I ask you something?

507
00:39:04.034 --> 00:39:05.000
Of course.

508
00:39:05.413 --> 00:39:08.275
If the Fire Nation
destroyed the Air Nomads...

509
00:39:09.103 --> 00:39:12.068
how can you suffer
the presence of the Fire Lord?

510
00:39:15.034 --> 00:39:16.896
Zuko is a friend and an ally.

511
00:39:17.413 --> 00:39:20.379
He turned against
his own father
to help me end the war.

512
00:39:20.482 --> 00:39:23.379
Yet he wears
the crown himself now.

513
00:39:24.413 --> 00:39:27.000
Fire by its nature burns. Aang.

514
00:39:27.827 --> 00:39:31.655
Our kind have always
suffered at the hands
of the other elements.

515
00:39:33.000 --> 00:39:34.827
That's why
we built Republic City.

516
00:39:35.344 --> 00:39:37.793
To show the world that
if we listen to each other.

517
00:39:37.931 --> 00:39:40.103
we can all live
together in peace.

518
00:39:41.793 --> 00:39:44.000
And once
we bring back Airbenders.

519
00:39:44.758 --> 00:39:46.172
it'll be complete.

520
00:39:49.310 --> 00:39:51.413
When everyone stuck
to their own.

521
00:39:51.551 --> 00:39:53.965
the whole world
was nearly torn apart.

522
00:39:54.758 --> 00:39:59.137
And besides. Katara.
Sokka. Zuko. Toph...

523
00:39:59.275 --> 00:40:00.862
they're my family now.

524
00:40:02.000 --> 00:40:05.103
I want to live in a world
where we can all be together.

525
00:40:06.482 --> 00:40:09.000
You remind me so much of Sonam.

526
00:40:13.586 --> 00:40:14.827
It's the Avatar.

527
00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:17.379
And this time he's got
his friends with him.

528
00:40:17.482 --> 00:40:19.034
That's the Fire Lord's airship!

529
00:40:19.206 --> 00:40:21.620
How'd they get ahead of us?
They don't even have the map!

530
00:40:22.137 --> 00:40:24.137
We can't risk him
getting to the staff first.

531
00:40:24.310 --> 00:40:25.172
Kill him.

532
00:40:25.344 --> 00:40:26.620
But he spared our lives.

533
00:40:27.413 --> 00:40:29.655
And how many countless were
killed in the hundred years

534
00:40:29.827 --> 00:40:30.931
waiting for his return?

535
00:40:31.137 --> 00:40:33.620
Where was he when
your family was wiped out?

536
00:40:33.758 --> 00:40:35.172
If we want anything to change.

537
00:40:35.344 --> 00:40:38.310
we need what
the Benders have... Power.

538
00:40:46.655 --> 00:40:47.862
Fire!

539
00:40:53.413 --> 00:40:54.965
It's the Denied!

540
00:40:57.482 --> 00:40:59.689
Uh. we are definitely
under attack!

541
00:41:01.379 --> 00:41:02.931
Tear them to shreds!

542
00:41:15.827 --> 00:41:17.689
Is he crushing the ship?

543
00:41:19.793 --> 00:41:20.862
Tagah?

544
00:41:21.689 --> 00:41:22.862
Tagah. stop!

545
00:41:48.137 --> 00:41:49.379
We're here.

546
00:41:51.344 --> 00:41:53.206
The Immortal Storm.

547
00:41:53.724 --> 00:41:54.655
Oh. no.

548
00:42:00.034 --> 00:42:02.758
There has to be
another way around.
No!

549
00:42:02.896 --> 00:42:05.310
Together. you and I
can clear a path for the ship.

550
00:42:05.482 --> 00:42:06.827
But we have to go now.

551
00:42:07.689 --> 00:42:09.896
Aang. trust me.

552
00:42:13.103 --> 00:42:15.103
Uh. maybe now's
a good time to turn back.

553
00:42:15.275 --> 00:42:17.793
I don't think
that's an option anymore.

554
00:42:17.931 --> 00:42:19.241
Where are they going?

555
00:42:27.827 --> 00:42:30.172
The engine's out.
We're losing air pressure.

556
00:42:32.068 --> 00:42:33.275
Whoa!

557
00:42:35.758 --> 00:42:38.206
Katara. Toph. come with me.
What about me?

558
00:42:38.344 --> 00:42:39.413
Take the wheel.

559
00:42:39.793 --> 00:42:42.310
What? No. I've only ever
crashed Fire Nation airships.

560
00:42:43.758 --> 00:42:45.275
Okay. let's see.
Here's our rudder.

561
00:42:45.413 --> 00:42:46.896
this is the elevator.
there's our ballast.

562
00:42:47.034 --> 00:42:49.620
and there's the giant tornado
that's going to kill us all.

563
00:42:53.206 --> 00:42:54.655
Follow my lead.

564
00:43:05.793 --> 00:43:08.275
Work with me.
just like I showed you.

565
00:43:09.034 --> 00:43:10.758
We can harness the air.

566
00:43:21.068 --> 00:43:23.206
Yes! That's it. Aang!
Keep going!

567
00:43:33.310 --> 00:43:35.482
There's a long tear
above your head on the left.

568
00:43:35.620 --> 00:43:36.689
Got it!

569
00:43:37.034 --> 00:43:39.655
Whatever happens.
you have to hold
the ship together.

570
00:43:39.827 --> 00:43:41.482
Zuko! Zuko!

571
00:43:41.620 --> 00:43:43.586
Aang and Tagah
are destroying tornadoes.

572
00:43:43.689 --> 00:43:46.310
but there's too many.
and they're everywhere!

573
00:43:46.448 --> 00:43:48.482
Just steer the ship.
Don't lose Aang.

574
00:43:48.655 --> 00:43:49.793
It's not that easy.

575
00:43:49.931 --> 00:43:52.172
especially when
everything is sideways.

576
00:43:52.344 --> 00:43:54.000
Okay. left!

577
00:44:02.275 --> 00:44:04.310
I did it!

578
00:44:04.448 --> 00:44:06.413
Right!

579
00:44:14.448 --> 00:44:16.586
Oh. no!
We're falling behind!

580
00:44:17.586 --> 00:44:20.275
I'm losing sight of them!
We have to go back!

581
00:44:20.413 --> 00:44:21.586
Trust in your friends.

582
00:44:21.724 --> 00:44:24.275
They won't make it
if we don't clear a path.

583
00:44:37.275 --> 00:44:39.413
Zuko! We're gonna
crash into the sea!

584
00:44:39.586 --> 00:44:43.034
When I give you the signal.
pull the lever
next to the wheel.

585
00:44:47.379 --> 00:44:49.241
We're gonna crash!
We're gonna crash!

586
00:44:49.517 --> 00:44:50.655
Katara?

587
00:45:10.344 --> 00:45:12.137
Give me the signal!
Give me the signal!

588
00:45:16.827 --> 00:45:18.034
It's closed!

589
00:45:19.482 --> 00:45:20.896
Sokka. now!

590
00:45:21.000 --> 00:45:22.275
Here we go!

591
00:45:45.000 --> 00:45:47.172
Katara! We did it!

592
00:45:48.103 --> 00:45:49.655
What were you thinking?

593
00:45:49.793 --> 00:45:51.103
I was clearing the tornadoes
to make a path.

594
00:45:51.241 --> 00:45:53.344
The ship almost crashed. Aang.
We could have died.

595
00:45:53.517 --> 00:45:55.793
And what if you
got yourself killed?

596
00:45:55.965 --> 00:45:56.965
You're the Avatar.

597
00:45:57.103 --> 00:45:59.758
This is too risky.
We need to turn back now.

598
00:45:59.896 --> 00:46:02.206
No! We're almost there.

599
00:46:02.344 --> 00:46:05.172
We just need to get
to the eye of the storm.

600
00:46:05.793 --> 00:46:08.241
Aang. no.
This is too dangerous.

601
00:46:08.413 --> 00:46:11.034
The staff is out there.
The Denied are after it.

602
00:46:11.172 --> 00:46:13.758
Do you really believe
that they could make it
through the storm?

603
00:46:13.862 --> 00:46:14.965
We're nearly there.

604
00:46:15.103 --> 00:46:17.034
That staff
can bring back my people.

605
00:46:17.172 --> 00:46:18.482
I understand how much
you want that. but...

606
00:46:18.620 --> 00:46:20.896
You don't understand.
None of you do.

607
00:46:22.137 --> 00:46:23.517
Aang...

608
00:46:25.413 --> 00:46:26.379
We push forward.

609
00:46:30.206 --> 00:46:33.379
If we generate enough air.
we can push our way through.

610
00:47:17.344 --> 00:47:19.413
We're alive?

611
00:47:20.034 --> 00:47:22.620
We made it through.
Thank you. Tagah.

612
00:47:22.758 --> 00:47:25.448
It was you. Aang.
We're here because of you.

613
00:47:25.620 --> 00:47:27.241
Yeah. we're having
a good time. too.

614
00:47:27.448 --> 00:47:29.758
You could have told us
we were flying into
the Immortal Storm.

615
00:47:29.931 --> 00:47:32.517
I know it was dangerous.
but we had to risk it.

616
00:47:32.655 --> 00:47:33.758
We?

617
00:47:33.896 --> 00:47:35.862
I don't remember when
we took a vote on that.

618
00:47:36.000 --> 00:47:38.137
There wasn't time.
I had to make a call.

619
00:47:38.275 --> 00:47:40.103
Friends. please.
don't blame Aang.

620
00:47:40.241 --> 00:47:41.827
This is all my fault.

621
00:47:41.931 --> 00:47:43.655
I knew this would be difficult.

622
00:47:44.448 --> 00:47:47.068
But Aang believed
in your strength as a team.

623
00:47:47.206 --> 00:47:49.310
And I'm honored
to be a part of it.

624
00:47:55.310 --> 00:47:56.931
I forgive you. Tagah.

625
00:47:57.379 --> 00:47:59.103
Everyone. look.

626
00:48:00.413 --> 00:48:04.724
These islands.
they were Lion Turtles.

627
00:48:06.586 --> 00:48:07.689
Whoa.

628
00:48:09.034 --> 00:48:10.517
It's beautiful.

629
00:48:12.827 --> 00:48:14.551
Long before my time.

630
00:48:14.689 --> 00:48:16.413
the Lion Turtles
granted the gift

631
00:48:16.551 --> 00:48:18.172
of bending to humans.

632
00:48:18.758 --> 00:48:21.620
These are their final
resting grounds.

633
00:48:21.724 --> 00:48:25.034
This is where Sonam came
to learn their ways.

634
00:48:25.724 --> 00:48:29.172
I am certain that
she left her staff here.

635
00:48:29.344 --> 00:48:30.827
Where should we start looking?

636
00:48:31.000 --> 00:48:33.827
Aang. you must
connect with her.

637
00:48:34.517 --> 00:48:37.413
But no one
can connect with Sonam.

638
00:48:37.517 --> 00:48:39.482
The spiritual power
of the Lion Turtles

639
00:48:39.655 --> 00:48:41.413
is still
concentrated here.

640
00:48:41.517 --> 00:48:43.103
Let it guide you.

641
00:48:43.551 --> 00:48:44.965
We'll set out immediately.

642
00:48:45.137 --> 00:48:47.965
Actually. Tagah.
we could really
use your help here.

643
00:48:48.068 --> 00:48:51.172
If the Denied are close behind.
we need to be ready.

644
00:48:51.310 --> 00:48:54.000
Yeah. and we're gonna need more
than Toph's metal bending

645
00:48:54.137 --> 00:48:55.172
to fix this ship.

646
00:48:55.379 --> 00:48:57.206
My bending got us
through that storm.

647
00:48:57.344 --> 00:48:58.344
What did you do?

648
00:48:58.517 --> 00:48:59.655
Steered with his feet.

649
00:48:59.793 --> 00:49:01.206
Repairs can wait.

650
00:49:01.310 --> 00:49:02.517
Aang needs me.

651
00:49:02.689 --> 00:49:06.413
Tagah. please.
stay and help my friends.

652
00:49:06.931 --> 00:49:08.620
I'll be okay on my own.

653
00:49:09.241 --> 00:49:10.344
As you wish.

654
00:49:10.724 --> 00:49:13.586
We will begin repairs
for our voyage home.

655
00:49:15.448 --> 00:49:19.206
Everyone. I know
I've asked a lot of you
on this journey.

656
00:49:19.344 --> 00:49:21.551
but we're about
to accomplish something

657
00:49:21.689 --> 00:49:23.586
that will change the world.

658
00:50:14.896 --> 00:50:16.620
Let it guide you.

659
00:50:32.793 --> 00:50:34.241
Sonam?

660
00:50:52.206 --> 00:50:55.931
Oh. this is turning out to be
a nice little vacation.

661
00:50:56.103 --> 00:50:58.482
Aside from all the people
trying to kill us.

662
00:50:58.586 --> 00:50:59.448
And the tornadoes.

663
00:50:59.862 --> 00:51:02.137
Um. we're supposed
to be fixing the ship?

664
00:51:02.275 --> 00:51:03.965
You're doing great. buddy.

665
00:51:04.103 --> 00:51:06.275
Has anyone seen Tagah?

666
00:51:06.379 --> 00:51:08.000
Yes. we've all seen Tagah.

667
00:51:08.172 --> 00:51:10.689
He's so gorgeous.
Jeez. I get it.

668
00:51:11.344 --> 00:51:12.517
Oh. I see what you mean.

669
00:51:12.689 --> 00:51:14.310
He wandered off that way.

670
00:51:14.482 --> 00:51:16.758
No. maybe that way?

671
00:51:50.482 --> 00:51:51.724
Tagah!

672
00:51:52.206 --> 00:51:54.068
Where are you going?

673
00:51:54.172 --> 00:51:55.896
Aang needs to be protected.

674
00:51:56.448 --> 00:51:57.655
I agree.

675
00:52:00.172 --> 00:52:03.068
I know my ways
may seem unusual to you.

676
00:52:03.206 --> 00:52:06.172
but I assure you.
everything I do.

677
00:52:06.275 --> 00:52:07.517
I do for Aang.

678
00:52:07.655 --> 00:52:10.379
For Aang?
Or for the staff?

679
00:52:11.586 --> 00:52:14.275
You have no idea
all that we've lost.

680
00:52:14.413 --> 00:52:16.827
You've never known
a world with Airbenders.

681
00:52:17.482 --> 00:52:19.034
I know Aang.

682
00:52:19.689 --> 00:52:21.586
He may be the last of his kind.

683
00:52:21.758 --> 00:52:24.241
but he's the reason
this world knows peace.

684
00:52:27.965 --> 00:52:31.862
His values as an Air Nomad
have brought balance to chaos.

685
00:52:34.172 --> 00:52:37.379
It's because of Aang
that the Water Tribes.

686
00:52:37.517 --> 00:52:41.034
Earth Kingdom. and Fire Nation
now work together.

687
00:52:41.172 --> 00:52:43.068
striving for harmony.

688
00:52:43.241 --> 00:52:45.827
a peace we once
thought unattainable.

689
00:52:48.379 --> 00:52:49.896
You speak of peace.

690
00:52:50.068 --> 00:52:53.068
There will never be peace
among the elements.

691
00:52:53.241 --> 00:52:54.379
There never was.

692
00:52:54.689 --> 00:52:57.586
Your precious Republic City
is built on lies.

693
00:52:57.724 --> 00:52:59.896
It's built on hope.

694
00:53:00.068 --> 00:53:01.517
Do you have hope. Tagah?

695
00:53:01.655 --> 00:53:04.655
Saving my people requires
more than just hope.

696
00:53:04.827 --> 00:53:06.517
It requires sacrifice.

697
00:53:06.689 --> 00:53:09.620
I saw you try to crush
the Denied's airships.

698
00:53:09.758 --> 00:53:11.448
You were ready to kill them.

699
00:53:13.689 --> 00:53:16.448
I know what kind
of Airbender Aang is...

700
00:53:18.931 --> 00:53:21.137
but what kind
of Airbender are you?

701
00:53:49.758 --> 00:53:51.586
Aang did well
getting us here.

702
00:53:52.034 --> 00:53:55.758
There is great strength in him.
but weakness as well.

703
00:53:55.896 --> 00:53:57.034
Weakness?

704
00:53:57.137 --> 00:53:58.379
Yes.

705
00:53:58.482 --> 00:53:59.551
You.

706
00:54:16.172 --> 00:54:17.275
What the hog monkey?

707
00:54:21.206 --> 00:54:22.241
No!

708
00:54:40.965 --> 00:54:42.620
He trusted you!

709
00:54:49.551 --> 00:54:50.724
No.

710
00:54:54.379 --> 00:54:55.896
You traitor!

711
00:55:43.793 --> 00:55:45.103
Tagah!

712
00:56:11.068 --> 00:56:12.172
Brother.

713
00:56:15.103 --> 00:56:17.413
Tagah. It's real.

714
00:56:21.793 --> 00:56:24.206
We can finally
bring back airbending.

715
00:56:27.379 --> 00:56:28.620
Let's go tell the others.

716
00:56:28.758 --> 00:56:30.000
We can do this.

717
00:56:30.689 --> 00:56:32.034
Me and you.

718
00:56:32.689 --> 00:56:34.724
I can't do this
without my friends.

719
00:56:36.862 --> 00:56:39.931
Earth killed my people.
Fire killed yours.

720
00:56:40.034 --> 00:56:44.034
The staff is the only way
we can create a new Air Empire.

721
00:56:44.172 --> 00:56:46.482
One capable of defending itself.

722
00:56:46.620 --> 00:56:47.655
No.

723
00:56:47.793 --> 00:56:49.793
We can build
a new future. Tagah.

724
00:56:49.931 --> 00:56:51.862
But it has to be for everyone.

725
00:56:52.034 --> 00:56:54.172
The staff doesn't
belong to everyone.

726
00:56:54.310 --> 00:56:55.448
It belongs to us.

727
00:56:55.586 --> 00:56:57.413
What...
What have you done?

728
00:56:57.586 --> 00:57:01.344
As long as they were
around. you'd always put them
ahead of our people.

729
00:57:01.448 --> 00:57:04.965
Don't you see?
This is how we redeem ourselves.

730
00:57:05.586 --> 00:57:07.344
It doesn't matter
that you ran then.

731
00:57:07.448 --> 00:57:09.448
As long as you stand
with me now.

732
00:57:09.620 --> 00:57:12.413
Aang. listen to me.

733
00:57:12.551 --> 00:57:13.931
This is the only way.

734
00:57:27.724 --> 00:57:29.655
You're a traitor to your own.

735
00:57:29.758 --> 00:57:31.931
Just like Sonam.

736
00:58:09.655 --> 00:58:12.172
I wanted to do this
with you by my side.

737
00:58:13.137 --> 00:58:15.827
But if I must build
the new Air Empire alone...

738
00:58:16.896 --> 00:58:18.172
so be it.

739
00:58:26.241 --> 00:58:29.482
There's no way in!
We have to turn back!

740
00:58:29.620 --> 00:58:32.620
No! We keep trying
to push through!

741
00:58:45.000 --> 00:58:46.689
Sonam's staff.

742
00:58:47.551 --> 00:58:48.965
Denied...

743
00:58:49.103 --> 00:58:50.758
the Avatar is dead.

744
00:58:51.137 --> 00:58:54.000
If you wish to build a new world
where you have the power.

745
00:58:54.137 --> 00:58:55.896
I can give it to you.

746
00:59:11.206 --> 00:59:12.344
Appa!

747
00:59:12.517 --> 00:59:14.172
Katara!

748
00:59:14.310 --> 00:59:15.724
Katara!

749
00:59:17.034 --> 00:59:18.241
Katara.

750
00:59:18.896 --> 00:59:20.241
They're gone.

751
00:59:20.827 --> 00:59:22.344
It's all my fault.

752
00:59:23.206 --> 00:59:24.896
It's always been my fault.

753
00:59:25.413 --> 00:59:27.344
Ever since I ran away.

754
00:59:28.965 --> 00:59:32.413
No Avatar has ever
fallen into such shame

755
00:59:32.586 --> 00:59:34.793
as to join me
here in my sorrow.

756
00:59:36.793 --> 00:59:38.724
Why do you grieve so. friend?

757
00:59:39.241 --> 00:59:41.241
Avatar Sonam?

758
00:59:43.862 --> 00:59:45.724
Tagah murdered my friends.

759
00:59:46.310 --> 00:59:47.965
And now he has the staff.

760
00:59:48.103 --> 00:59:49.827
Tagah? No.

761
00:59:49.965 --> 00:59:52.793
No. I... I stopped him.

762
00:59:52.896 --> 00:59:54.344
I hid the staff.

763
00:59:54.793 --> 00:59:56.965
What have you done?

764
00:59:57.689 --> 00:59:59.862
You're the one
who gave him airbending!

765
01:00:00.310 --> 01:00:02.586
How could you give power
to a monster?

766
01:00:03.137 --> 01:00:06.862
The Tagah I gave bending to
was a different man.

767
01:00:08.448 --> 01:00:10.206
It was a different time.

768
01:00:10.965 --> 01:00:13.793
The Airbenders were
the peacekeepers
of the four elements.

769
01:00:14.310 --> 01:00:16.862
We used our power
to mediate all conflict

770
01:00:17.034 --> 01:00:18.275
with non-violence.

771
01:00:18.793 --> 01:00:20.793
But we were
the fewest in numbers.

772
01:00:21.724 --> 01:00:25.310
For many years. we existed
in a beautiful balance

773
01:00:25.413 --> 01:00:26.965
of great prosperity.

774
01:00:27.068 --> 01:00:28.965
But the world began to shift.

775
01:00:29.689 --> 01:00:31.965
The Earthbenders
formed their own kingdom.

776
01:00:32.103 --> 01:00:34.689
separating from
the other elemental tribes.

777
01:00:35.379 --> 01:00:37.482
The balance of the world
was at risk.

778
01:00:37.896 --> 01:00:40.034
It was my duty to act.

779
01:00:41.068 --> 01:00:42.724
So I learned how
to channel the energy

780
01:00:42.896 --> 01:00:45.448
of the Spirit World
just as the Lion Turtles did.

781
01:00:45.793 --> 01:00:48.862
To give people
the power of airbending.

782
01:00:49.758 --> 01:00:51.413
My most devout pupil.

783
01:00:51.551 --> 01:00:54.241
Tagah. was the first
to receive it.

784
01:00:55.241 --> 01:00:57.103
I sent my new peacekeepers out

785
01:00:57.206 --> 01:00:59.310
to help calm
the growing unrest.

786
01:01:00.137 --> 01:01:02.793
But they were not prepared
for the brutality

787
01:01:02.965 --> 01:01:05.103
of the new Earth Kingdom.

788
01:01:07.034 --> 01:01:08.310
Tagah watched

789
01:01:08.724 --> 01:01:12.137
as his brothers and sisters
were all slaughtered.

790
01:01:13.034 --> 01:01:15.793
His heart darkened
by the violence of war.

791
01:01:16.275 --> 01:01:20.517
He now saw everyone
who wasn't an Air Nomad
as the enemy.

792
01:01:21.896 --> 01:01:24.137
Tagah begged me to use
the staff to create an army

793
01:01:24.310 --> 01:01:26.965
and to kill
all who would do us harm.

794
01:01:27.413 --> 01:01:28.896
I refused.

795
01:01:29.275 --> 01:01:30.379
So he stole it.

796
01:01:32.137 --> 01:01:33.793
When he connected the staff
to the temple.

797
01:01:33.931 --> 01:01:36.931
his energy was so corrupted
by grief and rage

798
01:01:37.068 --> 01:01:38.931
that the power
of the Spirit World

799
01:01:39.068 --> 01:01:40.103
consumed him.

800
01:01:40.896 --> 01:01:44.068
Tagah became something
more than human.

801
01:01:44.206 --> 01:01:45.689
too powerful to kill.

802
01:01:46.793 --> 01:01:49.344
It took all my energy
to finally trap him

803
01:01:49.448 --> 01:01:53.241
high above the clouds.
where no one would find him.

804
01:01:54.172 --> 01:01:56.068
I reclaimed the staff.

805
01:01:56.551 --> 01:01:58.172
but I was fatally wounded.

806
01:01:58.793 --> 01:02:01.379
Before the Earth Kingdom
could invade Jharana.

807
01:02:01.517 --> 01:02:04.379
I sent the remaining Air Nomads
into the mountains.

808
01:02:05.275 --> 01:02:07.413
And I hid my temple
in the Spirit World.

809
01:02:07.517 --> 01:02:10.000
where no one
could access its power.

810
01:02:11.620 --> 01:02:13.862
Then I locked the staff away.

811
01:02:14.034 --> 01:02:16.551
where only the Avatar
could find it.

812
01:02:17.827 --> 01:02:20.586
I died. hoping that one day.

813
01:02:20.689 --> 01:02:23.206
another Avatar would
create more Airbenders

814
01:02:23.344 --> 01:02:25.689
and restore balance
to this world.

815
01:02:26.448 --> 01:02:29.034
And that Avatar is you. Aang.

816
01:02:29.172 --> 01:02:30.655
You have to get my staff

817
01:02:30.793 --> 01:02:32.655
before Tagah connects it
to the temple.

818
01:02:33.172 --> 01:02:34.620
There's still time.

819
01:02:34.724 --> 01:02:36.793
Don't let my regret
become yours.

820
01:02:37.482 --> 01:02:39.931
My friends and I
fought hard for this peace.

821
01:02:40.344 --> 01:02:42.793
I won't let him
start another war.

822
01:02:42.931 --> 01:02:44.551
Help me find a way back.

823
01:02:46.310 --> 01:02:47.379
Sonam?

824
01:02:48.655 --> 01:02:49.896
What's happening?

825
01:02:52.068 --> 01:02:53.068
No!

826
01:02:53.206 --> 01:02:54.793
No! Please!

827
01:02:54.931 --> 01:02:56.103
I have to fix this!

828
01:02:56.206 --> 01:02:58.551
This can't be it!
I can't die yet!

829
01:02:58.689 --> 01:03:00.172
Please! Not yet!

830
01:03:00.310 --> 01:03:01.758
No!
Aang?

831
01:03:01.896 --> 01:03:03.620
Katara?
I'm losing him.

832
01:03:03.758 --> 01:03:06.206
Come on. Aang!
Come on! Aang!

833
01:03:06.310 --> 01:03:07.896
Hold on!

834
01:03:08.034 --> 01:03:09.344
Aang!

835
01:03:10.551 --> 01:03:11.551
Katara!

836
01:03:11.689 --> 01:03:13.000
I was so worried.

837
01:03:13.413 --> 01:03:14.379
Aang!

838
01:03:14.517 --> 01:03:16.482
Sokka!

839
01:03:16.620 --> 01:03:18.000
I knew you'd
pull through. buddy.

840
01:03:18.103 --> 01:03:19.034
Hey. Aang.

841
01:03:19.137 --> 01:03:20.379
Zuko!

842
01:03:20.482 --> 01:03:21.724
Momo!

843
01:03:22.241 --> 01:03:23.931
Welcome back. twinkle toes.

844
01:03:24.068 --> 01:03:25.862
Toph. you're okay.

845
01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:27.241
I...

846
01:03:27.379 --> 01:03:28.586
I thought you were all dead.

847
01:03:28.724 --> 01:03:31.862
We were.
But Katara saved us.

848
01:03:31.965 --> 01:03:33.862
The spiritual power
of these waters

849
01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:36.241
strengthened
my healing abilities.

850
01:03:38.965 --> 01:03:40.448
You're incredible. Katara.

851
01:03:42.551 --> 01:03:43.793
Where's Appa?

852
01:03:45.137 --> 01:03:46.793
Tagah must have taken him.

853
01:03:47.413 --> 01:03:48.655
I'm sorry.

854
01:03:49.137 --> 01:03:50.275
No.

855
01:03:51.413 --> 01:03:53.482
I can't believe I trusted him.

856
01:03:55.448 --> 01:03:57.241
We'll get through this.

857
01:03:59.620 --> 01:04:01.482
So. let me get this straight.

858
01:04:01.620 --> 01:04:04.620
He's pulling Sonam's temple
out of the Spirit World

859
01:04:04.724 --> 01:04:07.172
to gain unlimited power.
and let me guess.

860
01:04:07.310 --> 01:04:08.862
you want us to stop him?

861
01:04:09.758 --> 01:04:12.137
Sure. only problem
is your air bro

862
01:04:12.275 --> 01:04:14.827
crushed our ship
and stole your bison.

863
01:04:14.965 --> 01:04:18.206
Also. there's a massive
typhoon surrounding us!

864
01:04:21.068 --> 01:04:24.586
I don't say this very often.
but Sokka's right.

865
01:04:24.724 --> 01:04:26.862
Thank you.
Yep. we're stuck.

866
01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:28.379
And there aren't
enough Lion Turtles

867
01:04:28.517 --> 01:04:30.275
for all of us
to have our own island.

868
01:04:30.413 --> 01:04:31.931
so I'm calling this one.

869
01:04:32.034 --> 01:04:33.172
I'm naming him Snappy.

870
01:04:33.310 --> 01:04:35.620
Aw.
Snappy is the best one.

871
01:04:35.758 --> 01:04:36.827
I know.

872
01:04:36.965 --> 01:04:38.827
We may not know where Tagah is.

873
01:04:39.344 --> 01:04:40.862
but we know
what he's looking for

874
01:04:41.034 --> 01:04:42.344
is in the Spirit World.

875
01:04:42.931 --> 01:04:44.344
And lucky for us.

876
01:04:44.517 --> 01:04:46.758
we're stuck in the most
spiritually charged place

877
01:04:46.862 --> 01:04:47.862
on the planet.

878
01:04:48.448 --> 01:04:51.206
So I may be able to open
a portal to get us there.

879
01:04:51.379 --> 01:04:54.344
if I can summon an old friend.

880
01:05:02.793 --> 01:05:03.931
Wow.

881
01:05:04.793 --> 01:05:07.068
The ocean spirit.

882
01:05:14.448 --> 01:05:17.068
This portal smells an awful lot
like the fish market.

883
01:05:17.241 --> 01:05:19.034
I'm gonna go check on Snappy.

884
01:05:19.172 --> 01:05:20.827
Face your death with honor.

885
01:05:20.965 --> 01:05:22.172
I'm sorry.

886
01:05:22.275 --> 01:05:23.551
I know I got us into this.

887
01:05:23.689 --> 01:05:26.034
but I promise you
I'll fix it.

888
01:05:26.482 --> 01:05:27.965
We'll fix it...

889
01:05:28.379 --> 01:05:29.758
together.

890
01:05:32.758 --> 01:05:35.068
We're gonna die!
We're gonna die!

891
01:05:35.206 --> 01:05:37.586
Woah!

892
01:05:45.689 --> 01:05:47.620
What?
Where's my power pony?

893
01:05:47.758 --> 01:05:50.413
Uh. were my hands
always this small?

894
01:05:50.586 --> 01:05:52.000
It's Baby Toph!

895
01:05:52.137 --> 01:05:54.827
Baby Toph!

896
01:05:54.965 --> 01:05:56.965
What the hog monkey?

897
01:05:57.068 --> 01:05:58.206
Old people!

898
01:05:58.344 --> 01:05:59.241
Gran Gran?

899
01:05:59.551 --> 01:06:01.275
It's your sister.
you meathead!

900
01:06:01.413 --> 01:06:03.724
Give me Toph.
There. there. Toph.

901
01:06:03.862 --> 01:06:05.482
Oh. no. Zuko!

902
01:06:05.620 --> 01:06:07.241
What happened
to your beautiful face?

903
01:06:07.379 --> 01:06:10.206
You look like a dried sea squid.

904
01:06:10.310 --> 01:06:11.655
No. Zuko!
Tired.

905
01:06:11.793 --> 01:06:13.931
Ow. ow. ow!
What's going on here?

906
01:06:14.517 --> 01:06:16.862
The Spirit World
is out of balance.

907
01:06:17.517 --> 01:06:19.137
And so are we.

908
01:06:21.172 --> 01:06:22.689
That's gotta be Tagah.

909
01:06:44.482 --> 01:06:45.758
Oh. no!

910
01:06:45.965 --> 01:06:48.275
He's pulling Sonam's temple
into our world!

911
01:06:48.413 --> 01:06:49.896
We're running out of time!

912
01:06:50.310 --> 01:06:53.000
Chunder!

913
01:06:56.758 --> 01:06:58.517
Pretty good landing.

914
01:06:59.862 --> 01:07:01.379
Whoa! Humans!

915
01:07:01.517 --> 01:07:02.827
I love humans!

916
01:07:02.965 --> 01:07:04.379
Two brothers.
their little sister.

917
01:07:04.517 --> 01:07:05.724
and an elderly couple.

918
01:07:05.896 --> 01:07:07.379
A couple?
Not a couple!

919
01:07:07.517 --> 01:07:09.724
Whoa! Looks like
I touched a nerve.

920
01:07:09.862 --> 01:07:11.758
Oh. look at this one.

921
01:07:11.862 --> 01:07:13.034
Hello. Ow!

922
01:07:13.206 --> 01:07:15.000
Toph. no! Bad Toph.

923
01:07:15.137 --> 01:07:16.827
We don't bite strangers.

924
01:07:17.862 --> 01:07:19.448
Great Spirit. excuse me.

925
01:07:19.551 --> 01:07:21.482
Did you just come from
that temple in the sky?

926
01:07:21.620 --> 01:07:23.068
I certainly did.

927
01:07:23.827 --> 01:07:26.275
It was my favorite hidey-hole
until that dark.

928
01:07:26.379 --> 01:07:28.931
yucky energy started
corrupting this whole place.

929
01:07:29.551 --> 01:07:32.586
Please. we need your help
getting up there.

930
01:07:32.689 --> 01:07:34.517
It's my duty to stop this.

931
01:07:34.965 --> 01:07:36.862
I'm the Avatar.

932
01:07:37.413 --> 01:07:40.586
Ooh. the Avatar.

933
01:07:41.000 --> 01:07:42.275
Let me have a squiz at you.

934
01:07:42.379 --> 01:07:45.103
Okay. Now with this eye.
And this eye.

935
01:07:45.206 --> 01:07:47.034
Mm-hmm. And this eye.
Don't forget this eye.

936
01:07:47.172 --> 01:07:49.965
Hey. hey. can we hurry up?
Every eye needs
to have a squiz!

937
01:07:50.068 --> 01:07:51.206
Sniff check!

938
01:07:53.241 --> 01:07:55.586
Ooh. that's Avatar material
right there.

939
01:07:55.689 --> 01:07:58.068
Yes. it is. Oh!

940
01:07:58.206 --> 01:07:59.275
Yes. yes. yes. yes. yes.

941
01:07:59.379 --> 01:08:01.827
It appears the universe
has brought us together

942
01:08:01.931 --> 01:08:04.413
for a very important mission...

943
01:08:04.551 --> 01:08:05.931
Ah?

944
01:08:06.068 --> 01:08:07.344
...to flee!

945
01:08:07.896 --> 01:08:09.379
Run for your lives!

946
01:08:09.517 --> 01:08:10.896
Wait. come back!

947
01:08:11.034 --> 01:08:12.551
You're going the wrong way!

948
01:08:12.689 --> 01:08:13.758
Stop!

949
01:08:14.448 --> 01:08:16.068
Please. Great Spirit.
both of our worlds
are in danger!

950
01:08:16.206 --> 01:08:19.896
No. no. no. no. no. no.
I am not going back up there.

951
01:08:25.034 --> 01:08:28.413
Hmm. Well. when you
put it like that.
it does make more sense.

952
01:08:29.344 --> 01:08:31.827
Upon reflection.
I've decided I shall help you

953
01:08:31.931 --> 01:08:33.241
and your human-y friends.

954
01:08:33.379 --> 01:08:35.724
What did he say?
Nice work. Momo.

955
01:08:35.862 --> 01:08:37.965
All right. in you go.

956
01:08:40.827 --> 01:08:42.275
By the way.
no eating anything you find

957
01:08:42.448 --> 01:08:44.310
in my teeth. as I'm
saving that for later.

958
01:08:44.827 --> 01:08:46.758
Ready. set. get steady and ret.

959
01:08:46.896 --> 01:08:49.931
One and a two
and a you know what to do.

960
01:08:50.103 --> 01:08:51.448
Blast off!

961
01:08:56.379 --> 01:08:59.034
I know we haven't known
each other very long. but...

962
01:08:59.137 --> 01:09:00.517
I love you!

963
01:09:00.620 --> 01:09:02.241
You don't have to say it back.

964
01:09:11.000 --> 01:09:12.448
Hey! You got your hair back!

965
01:09:12.586 --> 01:09:15.517
Why are my eyes teary?
Was I crying?

966
01:09:16.344 --> 01:09:18.103
No way! Look!

967
01:09:18.206 --> 01:09:19.620
What?
What is it?

968
01:09:19.758 --> 01:09:21.517
It's Republic City.

969
01:09:24.827 --> 01:09:27.586
We can't let him destroy
everything we built!

970
01:09:27.724 --> 01:09:29.206
We won't.

971
01:09:44.482 --> 01:09:45.724
Boomerang!

972
01:10:03.103 --> 01:10:04.413
Give me the staff. Tagah!

973
01:10:04.517 --> 01:10:07.000
I see I underestimated you.
Avatar.

974
01:10:07.172 --> 01:10:10.103
Your friends are stronger
than I thought.

975
01:10:10.241 --> 01:10:11.862
But you're too late.

976
01:10:20.103 --> 01:10:21.241
The Denied.

977
01:10:21.689 --> 01:10:24.413
You see?
I did what you wanted. Aang.

978
01:10:24.517 --> 01:10:27.068
I returned airbending
to the world.

979
01:10:28.655 --> 01:10:29.827
What's the plan?

980
01:10:30.310 --> 01:10:33.103
We'll deal with the Denied.
You have to get the staff.

981
01:10:33.379 --> 01:10:36.413
I will rebuild Jharana
on the ruins of our enemies.

982
01:10:36.517 --> 01:10:38.310
just as they did on ours.

983
01:10:38.448 --> 01:10:41.137
A new Air Empire will rise.

984
01:10:41.655 --> 01:10:43.172
Kill them all.

985
01:11:01.482 --> 01:11:03.655
We have to get
these people out of here.

986
01:11:19.965 --> 01:11:21.517
Oh. yeah!

987
01:11:28.551 --> 01:11:29.827
Tagah!

988
01:11:29.965 --> 01:11:31.310
Give it to me!

989
01:11:33.068 --> 01:11:34.344
This isn't the way!

990
01:11:34.482 --> 01:11:37.482
We can use the staff
to bring back balance. peace!

991
01:11:37.586 --> 01:11:39.620
You care so much
about your ideals

992
01:11:39.724 --> 01:11:41.551
that you let
your people die!

993
01:11:42.241 --> 01:11:44.931
I will do anything
to make sure they survive!

994
01:12:03.448 --> 01:12:05.344
My cabbages!
Not my cabbages!

995
01:12:11.034 --> 01:12:13.655
My cabbages!

996
01:12:13.827 --> 01:12:17.517
My cabbages!

997
01:12:29.793 --> 01:12:30.965
Don't do this.

998
01:12:31.241 --> 01:12:33.862
You have the power now.
You can decide how to use it.

999
01:12:33.965 --> 01:12:34.965
I'm not like you.

1000
01:12:35.103 --> 01:12:36.448
The world hasn't
been good to me.

1001
01:12:36.620 --> 01:12:38.310
The world is what we make it.

1002
01:12:38.655 --> 01:12:40.172
Get away from her!

1003
01:13:12.379 --> 01:13:13.793
Tagah. stop!

1004
01:13:18.827 --> 01:13:20.827
You betrayed me!
You betrayed our culture!

1005
01:13:20.965 --> 01:13:23.482
I gave you every chance
to see the truth!

1006
01:13:29.448 --> 01:13:31.793
Shouldn't you be
in the Fire Nation?

1007
01:13:33.689 --> 01:13:36.137
I'm fighting for the peace
of all nations!

1008
01:13:39.482 --> 01:13:41.586
Big talk from someone
who sits on a throne

1009
01:13:41.689 --> 01:13:43.413
built on a century of war!

1010
01:14:06.448 --> 01:14:10.000
I'm still the greatest
Earthbender in the world!

1011
01:14:33.758 --> 01:14:36.586
Oh. no.
I'm out of water.

1012
01:14:38.103 --> 01:14:40.172
We got ya!

1013
01:14:40.586 --> 01:14:43.103
And there's no Avatar
here to save you.

1014
01:14:44.724 --> 01:14:47.000
Sokka-Cycle!
Huh?

1015
01:14:50.620 --> 01:14:52.413
Let's see if
your fancy new bending

1016
01:14:52.551 --> 01:14:55.172
can beat some good old
nonbending know-how.

1017
01:15:02.379 --> 01:15:04.068
Bombs away!

1018
01:15:10.310 --> 01:15:12.206
You just got denied!

1019
01:15:13.413 --> 01:15:14.655
Whoa!

1020
01:15:21.448 --> 01:15:24.000
Let's go!
Good luck saving your city.

1021
01:15:24.965 --> 01:15:26.000
Huh?

1022
01:15:31.827 --> 01:15:34.551
We have to save
as many people as we can.

1023
01:15:52.862 --> 01:15:54.275
I know your pain.

1024
01:15:54.413 --> 01:15:56.310
I know what you've been through.

1025
01:15:57.137 --> 01:15:58.448
You don't know.

1026
01:15:59.206 --> 01:16:03.344
I watched as all of my brothers
and sisters were slaughtered.

1027
01:16:04.000 --> 01:16:07.758
When the Fire Nation
burned the Air Nomads to ash.

1028
01:16:07.931 --> 01:16:09.034
where were you?

1029
01:16:10.068 --> 01:16:11.241
You ran!

1030
01:16:32.034 --> 01:16:33.275
Tagah!

1031
01:16:43.379 --> 01:16:44.275
No!

1032
01:17:06.931 --> 01:17:12.172
The full power
of the Spirit World
flows through me!

1033
01:17:21.827 --> 01:17:24.379
This is what strength
looks like!

1034
01:18:17.862 --> 01:18:19.724
You should've run away
like you did

1035
01:18:19.896 --> 01:18:23.068
all those years ago.
little Avatar.

1036
01:18:23.758 --> 01:18:24.931
I...

1037
01:18:26.000 --> 01:18:27.379
won't run.

1038
01:18:27.620 --> 01:18:32.137
Then at least you'll die
knowing you're not
the last Airbender!

1039
01:19:09.000 --> 01:19:10.344
Aang!

1040
01:19:18.206 --> 01:19:19.068
No!

1041
01:19:50.034 --> 01:19:51.137
No.

1042
01:20:26.172 --> 01:20:28.413
We could've been brothers!

1043
01:20:28.896 --> 01:20:30.758
We could've done this together!

1044
01:20:30.896 --> 01:20:33.379
It didn't have to end like this!

1045
01:20:38.689 --> 01:20:40.000
It's Aang!
He's got the staff!

1046
01:20:40.137 --> 01:20:42.517
Yeah!
Kick his butt. Mega Aang!

1047
01:20:42.655 --> 01:20:44.172
No! Something's wrong!

1048
01:20:44.310 --> 01:20:46.379
The power is corrupting him!

1049
01:21:04.241 --> 01:21:06.620
I dreamt of bringing
the Air Nomads back

1050
01:21:06.724 --> 01:21:08.413
to the world
as peacekeepers.

1051
01:21:08.551 --> 01:21:10.344
They could have been
a beacon of light

1052
01:21:10.482 --> 01:21:11.724
for the world to follow.

1053
01:21:11.896 --> 01:21:13.275
But you ruined it!

1054
01:21:13.448 --> 01:21:15.793
You twisted my dream
into a nightmare!

1055
01:21:16.344 --> 01:21:20.172
Finally. you have the power
the Air Nomads need.

1056
01:21:20.310 --> 01:21:22.724
Maybe there is hope
for you after all.

1057
01:21:33.206 --> 01:21:36.068
Do it!
Use the staff!

1058
01:21:36.206 --> 01:21:39.137
Show me you have the strength
to bring our people back!

1059
01:21:40.172 --> 01:21:41.241
Do it!

1060
01:22:18.103 --> 01:22:19.448
Aang.

1061
01:22:21.827 --> 01:22:25.068
You will do so many great things
as the Avatar.

1062
01:22:25.620 --> 01:22:29.517
but you must be prepared
to do what frightens you
the most.

1063
01:22:31.103 --> 01:22:36.000
Your people. your home.
we are always with you.

1064
01:22:52.482 --> 01:22:53.620
No.

1065
01:22:59.724 --> 01:23:01.172
No!

1066
01:23:24.379 --> 01:23:26.758
No! My power!

1067
01:23:32.896 --> 01:23:34.172
No.

1068
01:23:34.689 --> 01:23:35.896
No!

1069
01:23:45.344 --> 01:23:46.482
You fool!

1070
01:23:46.620 --> 01:23:48.034
Why?

1071
01:23:48.551 --> 01:23:50.413
Why did you break it?

1072
01:23:50.862 --> 01:23:54.482
We could have fixed everything.

1073
01:23:54.620 --> 01:23:57.310
We can't erase
the pain of the past.

1074
01:23:58.482 --> 01:23:59.724
We couldn't save them.

1075
01:23:59.896 --> 01:24:03.655
But it's our duty
to protect our people.

1076
01:24:03.827 --> 01:24:07.034
Not at the cost of betraying
everything they stood for.

1077
01:24:07.137 --> 01:24:08.413
No.

1078
01:24:08.931 --> 01:24:10.620
It's time to let go.

1079
01:24:11.620 --> 01:24:13.517
You have to forgive yourself.

1080
01:24:16.103 --> 01:24:18.344
I have to forgive myself too.

1081
01:24:27.206 --> 01:24:30.206
Air nomads are formed
from the mist.

1082
01:24:34.103 --> 01:24:38.103
We walk the world
for a moment in time.

1083
01:24:40.448 --> 01:24:44.758
Then we return
to the eternal wind.

1084
01:25:00.862 --> 01:25:02.413
Aang!

1085
01:25:05.965 --> 01:25:07.689
Hey. Katara.

1086
01:25:07.827 --> 01:25:09.000
Hey. Aang.

1087
01:25:11.482 --> 01:25:12.517
Seriously?

1088
01:25:12.655 --> 01:25:14.793
You do realize
you're falling. right?

1089
01:25:14.931 --> 01:25:17.241
Hey. if you ever get tired
of relying on Appa.

1090
01:25:17.344 --> 01:25:19.517
I could hook you up
with one of these babies.

1091
01:25:24.517 --> 01:25:26.827
I'll give you
the best friend discount!

1092
01:25:37.586 --> 01:25:38.931
These are pretty good!

1093
01:25:40.896 --> 01:25:43.310
I don't know
if airbending will ever return.

1094
01:25:43.896 --> 01:25:45.724
but I know now
that the true power

1095
01:25:45.862 --> 01:25:48.862
of the Air Nomads
was never their bending.

1096
01:25:49.448 --> 01:25:50.793
It was their values.

1097
01:25:51.517 --> 01:25:54.931
And that's a power
I can pass on to others.

1098
01:25:55.034 --> 01:25:58.379
Avatar Aang. you are
the true embodiment

1099
01:25:58.482 --> 01:26:00.034
of the Air Nomads.

1100
01:26:00.896 --> 01:26:04.172
Thank you for giving up
the power that I could not.

1101
01:26:04.862 --> 01:26:08.034
You give me hope for the future
of our culture.

1102
01:26:22.000 --> 01:26:23.724
It's amazing. isn't it?

1103
01:26:24.379 --> 01:26:27.379
The first new air temple
in centuries.

1104
01:26:28.413 --> 01:26:31.068
Republic City
is finally complete.

1105
01:26:34.965 --> 01:26:38.517
A city for all nations.
just like you promised.

1106
01:26:39.448 --> 01:26:41.931
I never could have done this
without you. Katara.

1107
01:26:43.413 --> 01:26:44.586
Hey. everybody.

1108
01:26:44.724 --> 01:26:46.413
Sorry I kept you all waiting.

1109
01:26:46.586 --> 01:26:48.379
Are you ready for our big trip?

1110
01:26:49.517 --> 01:26:53.000
As my new acolytes. you'll be
helping me preserve our culture

1111
01:26:53.103 --> 01:26:54.586
for future generations.

1112
01:26:55.379 --> 01:26:58.034
So. who wants
to search for artifacts

1113
01:26:58.172 --> 01:26:59.758
at an ancient
abandoned temple?

1114
01:26:59.931 --> 01:27:01.068
Yay.

1115
01:27:01.344 --> 01:27:02.517
I'm only going
to make sure you don't try

1116
01:27:02.689 --> 01:27:05.068
to release another
beefy old Airbender.

1117
01:27:05.206 --> 01:27:07.482
Yeah. I'm done
with bad boys.

1118
01:27:19.448 --> 01:27:21.551
Avatar Sonam told me
about this place.

1119
01:27:21.655 --> 01:27:24.241
So it's very possible
that no one's been here

1120
01:27:24.344 --> 01:27:26.000
in hundreds of years.

1121
01:27:27.241 --> 01:27:30.034
Oh! Is this
an Airbender relic?

1122
01:27:30.137 --> 01:27:31.758
I think that's just a rock.

1123
01:27:31.896 --> 01:27:33.620
But I love the enthusiasm.

1124
01:27:34.413 --> 01:27:36.137
Aw!

1125
01:27:39.655 --> 01:27:40.827
Keep your eyes open.

1126
01:27:40.965 --> 01:27:43.000
You never know what
we might discover here.

1127
01:27:44.655 --> 01:27:45.965
Woah!

1128
01:27:52.586 --> 01:27:54.103
I thought they were extinct.

1129
01:28:01.517 --> 01:28:03.034
I can't believe it.

1130
01:28:03.724 --> 01:28:05.655
The original Airbenders.

1131
01:28:12.793 --> 01:28:15.034
Aw. can I have one?

1132
01:28:16.379 --> 01:28:18.413
Appa. yip yip!
